    sh:description """Timing at an operation point
It has an attribute TimerQualifierCode with the following values:
PLA = Public Location Arrival
ELA = Earliest Location Arrival
ALA = Actual Location Arival
LLA = Latest Location Arrival
PLD = Public Location Departure
ELD = Earliest Location Departure
ALD = Actual Location Departure
LLD = Latest Location Departure
ERT = Earliest Run Through
ART = Actual Run Through
LRT = Latest Run Through    			
			"""@en ;
    sh:name "Timing at location"@en ;
    sh:node <http://data.europa.eu/949/shapes/NodeShape/TimingAtLocation/Timing> ;
    sh:nodeKind sh:IRI ;
    sh:property <http://data.europa.eu/949/shapes/PropertyShape/TimingAtLocation/DwellTime> ;
    sh:targetClass era:TimingAtLocation .

