    sh:class skos:Concept ;
    sh:description "Provides a possibility for differentiation between the objects: Train (TR), Route (RO), Path (PA), Case Reference (CR), Path Request (PR), Capacity Needs Announcements (CN), Capacity Model (CM), Catalogue Path (CP)"@en ;
